(savings account. It is not used for planned purchases or holidays.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Spending cap: Dining out and entertainment together must not exceed 12% of monthly) Tj T*
(income. Any overspend is made up in the following month.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
